    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-bunny_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 54,
      "y": 524
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すみれ",
    "text": "「慣れ……なのですかね。三波先輩が恥ずかしがっているのも」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すみれ",
    "text": "「……そういえば、円城寺先輩は美術への造詣も深いそうですね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すみれ",
    "text": "「なにか、アドバイスをいただけませんでしょうか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 22,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 14,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すみれ",
    "text": "「冴木先輩は『手を動かせ』としか言ってくれないのですよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 22,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
