    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bunny_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 54,
      "y": 524
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "れいか",
    "text": "「そうね……円城寺家の英才教育で、一定の審美眼と美術にかんする知識は得たけれど……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 13,
    "dress": "old-bunny",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bunny_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 54,
      "y": 524
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "れいか",
    "text": "「でも、知識と制作は別物ね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 13,
    "dress": "old-bunny",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bunny_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 54,
      "y": 524
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "れいか",
    "text": "「冴木さんの言うことももっともよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 13,
    "dress": "old-bunny",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bunny_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 54,
      "y": 524
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "れいか",
    "text": "「理論武装ばかりしていては肝心の制作をすることができなくなってしまう」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "れいか",
    "text": "「見識ばかりが先だって、いざ自分の制作をするとなると、思うように手を動かすことができずに挫折してしまう、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "れいか",
    "text": "「というひともすくなくはないと思うわ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 13,
    "dress": "old-bunny",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bunny_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 54,
      "y": 524
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "れいか",
    "text": "「もちろん、理論を学ぶことも重要だけれど……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "れいか",
    "text": "「過剰に知識を吸収しすぎて、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "れいか",
    "text": "「知識にがんじがらめにされて動けなくなってしまうのを、冴木さんは危惧していたんじゃないかしらね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
